      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Crate workspace",
      "items": [
        "11 <app>-prefixed crates: core · ports · auth · adminusers · widgets · warden · mailer · loom · api · sdk · cli",
        "adminusers (admin roster) and the sdk/cli clients follow the same slice pattern drawn here"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Hexagonal rings",
      "items": [
        "slices hold Arc<dyn Trait> repos behind ports; only the composition root names concrete Pg adapters",
        "SQL lives only in ports/src/adapters/*_pg.rs as runtime-checked sqlx::query strings"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Background + security",
      "items": [
        "loom runs run_outbox_worker + run_janitor and the realtime hub (rooms user:<id>)",
        "warden owns the HS256 JWT codec (jti == sessions.id), argon2id over an HMAC-SHA256 pepper, cookies and the error envelope"
      ]
    }
